data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_e8c27685-8c8a-4d65-aef2-bce9cf717da7","delta":"The edit was rejected"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_e8c27685-8c8a-4d65-aef2-bce9cf717da7","delta":" and marked as not retryable. The app's build reports that the schedule"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_e8c27685-8c8a-4d65-aef2-bce9cf717da7","delta":" change could not be applied — it appears the app's trigger definition isn't in a"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_e8c27685-8c8a-4d65-aef2-bce9cf717da7","delta":" form the editor can modify directly right now.\n\nHere's what you"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_e8c27685-8c8a-4d65-aef2-bce9cf717da7","delta":" can try to resolve this:\n\n- **Rebuild the app** with"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_e8c27685-8c8a-4d65-aef2-bce9cf717da7","delta":" the updated schedule baked in from the start. If you'd like,"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_e8c27685-8c8a-4d65-aef2-bce9cf717da7","delta":" I can create a new version of the Low Balance Alert app that runs every minute instead of daily at 8 AM,"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_1_e8c27685-8c8a-4d65-aef2-bce9cf717da7","delta":" keeping everything else identical.\n\nJust say the word and I'll rebuild it."}

